<report>
<title>Paired proportions</title>

<p>Total = <in>n_out</in>,  both = <in>r_out</in>,  first only = <in>s_out</in>,  second only = <in>t_out</in><br />
Proportion 1 = <inu>prop_1</inu><br />
Proportion 2 = <inu>prop_2</inu><br />
Proportion difference = <inu>prop_diff</inu></p>

<block name="exact">
<p><pval>Exact two sided <inp>cum_2</inp></pval><br />
<pval>Exact one sided <inp>cum_1</inp></pval></p>

<p><pval>Exact two sided mid <inp>cum_2_mid</inp></pval><br />
<pval>Exact one sided mid <inp>cum_1_mid</inp></pval></p>
</block>
<block name="approx">
<p><warn>Numbers too large for exact test</warn><br />
Standard normal deviate z = <inu>z</inu><br />
Approximate two sided <in>p_2</in><br />
Approximate one sided <in>p_1</in></p>
</block>

<p><ci><in>qcl</in> <in>pc</in>% confidence interval for the proportion difference:</ci><br />
<ci><inu>lower</inu> to <inu>upper</inu></ci></p>
</report>
